        <h2 class="t-1" style="margin-top:14px">Effervescence is<br>a <span class="grad">humidity problem</span>.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px">An effervescent tablet is an acid and a base held apart by nothing but dryness. Let moisture in and the reaction starts early &mdash; weeks later, in a warehouse, someone opens a tube of powder.</p>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px">Our rooms are held under 25% RH from granulation through to pack. It is the one variable everything else follows from.</p>
        <a class="btn soft" style="margin-top:26px" href="#/manufacturing">Inside the facility <i>&rarr;</i></a>
