<div class="page" id="pg-about" data-route="/about" data-title="About & founders — our story, values and facility | Ascovita Healthcare" data-desc="Founded in Anand, Gujarat to make premium nutrition accessible. Our mission, timeline, six core values and the three founders you work with directly on every B2B enquiry." hidden>

<section class="phero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow rv">Our story</p>
    <h1 class="t-hero rv s1" style="margin-top:18px">Why Ascovita<br><span class="grad">exists</span>.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv s2">Founded in Anand, Gujarat &mdash; India's nutraceutical capital &mdash; with a single mission: make premium-grade nutrition accessible to every Indian family, without compromising on quality or affordability.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card rv">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2 class="t-2">The problem we started with</h2>
          <p class="sm" style="margin-top:16px">India has the world's highest rate of micronutrient deficiency &mdash; yet most supplement brands charge a premium that keeps quality nutrition out of reach for millions. We founded Ascovita to break that cycle.</p>
          <p class="sm" style="margin-top:14px">From our GMP-certified facility in Anand we formulate, manufacture and deliver premium nutraceuticals &mdash; effervescent tablets, spirulina, glutathione, biotin and more &mdash; at prices that make good health genuinely accessible.</p>
          <p class="sm" style="margin-top:14px">Owning the plant is what makes that possible. There is no contract manufacturer in the middle taking a margin, and nobody else deciding what quality means on our behalf.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card sunk">
          <p class="lede" style="font-style:italic">&ldquo;From formulation to manufacturing of nutraceutical products &mdash; one standard, no shortcuts.&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="xs" style="margin-top:16px">&mdash; The Ascovita Healthcare promise</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="narrow center rv">
      <p class="eyebrow">Timeline</p>
      <h2 class="t-1" style="margin-top:14px">How we got here</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4vw,48px)">
      <div class="card rv" data-tilt><span class="chip">Founded</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">Ascovita Healthcare established</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Founded in Anand &mdash; India's nutraceutical capital &mdash; with a vision to make premium health accessible to all Indians.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv s1" data-tilt><span class="chip">Plant</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">Our own GMP-certified unit</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Near Rajshivalay Cinema, Anand. An FSSAI-licensed plant producing effervescent, capsule, tablet and strip formats in-house.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv s2" data-tilt><span class="chip">Growth</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">D2C launch &amp; B2B expansion</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Launched direct-to-consumer across India and opened third-party manufacturing for brands, clinics and distributors.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv s3" data-tilt><span class="chip">Today</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">10,000+ customers and growing</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Serving retail customers across India and B2B partners globally, with franchise and export opportunities open.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="narrow center rv">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we stand for</p>
      <h2 class="t-1" style="margin-top:14px">Our core values</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rows" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4vw,44px)">
      <div class="row rv"><h3 class="t-3">Organic first</h3><p class="sm">We source FSSAI-certified organic ingredients with full traceability from farm to capsule.</p></div>
      <div class="row rv"><h3 class="t-3">Science-backed</h3><p class="sm">Every formulation is developed from peer-reviewed research and validated by certified nutritionists and food scientists.</p></div>
      <div class="row rv"><h3 class="t-3">Fair pricing</h3><p class="sm">Premium-grade supplements priced for every Indian family &mdash; no compromise, no markups for profit's sake.</p></div>
      <div class="row rv"><h3 class="t-3">Made in India</h3><p class="sm">Manufactured in Anand, Gujarat, supporting Indian agriculture, jobs and infrastructure.</p></div>
      <div class="row rv"><h3 class="t-3">Partner-first</h3><p class="sm">B2B partners and distributors get dedicated account support, flexible MOQs and co-branded packaging.</p></div>
      <div class="row rv"><h3 class="t-3">Community</h3><p class="sm">We partner with local farmers, support rural agricultural communities and reinvest in India's health ecosystem.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="narrow center rv">
      <p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p>
      <h2 class="t-1" style="margin-top:14px">The founders you<br><span class="grad">work directly with</span></h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;margin-inline:auto">No sales reps, no delays. Every B2B enquiry reaches our leadership team directly. That is the Ascovita promise.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4vw,48px)">
      <article class="card dvc rv" data-tilt style="--dot:#2E7D32">
        <span class="chip">Strategy</span>
        <h3 class="t-2" style="margin-top:16px">Amit Dantani</h3>
        <p class="where">Founder &amp; CEO</p>
        <p class="sm">Leads strategic partnerships, enterprise accounts, supply chain and overall business direction. First point of contact for bulk deals and long-term B2B agreements.</p>
