<div class="page" id="pg-manufacturing" data-route="/manufacturing" data-title="Manufacturing — WHO-GMP effervescent tablet facility | Ascovita Healthcare" data-desc="Humidity-controlled effervescent manufacturing in Anand, Gujarat. Six dosage formats, third-party lab testing, full farm-to-capsule traceability and batch documentation on every release." hidden>

<section class="phero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow rv">Manufacturing</p>
    <h1 class="t-hero rv s1" style="margin-top:18px">Effervescence is a<br><span class="grad">humidity problem</span>.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv s2">An effervescent tablet is an acid and a base held apart by nothing but dryness. Everything about how we build a batch follows from that one fact.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="art-shell rv">
      <canvas class="art-canvas"></canvas>
      <p class="art-cap">Raymarched in real time &mdash; scroll to dissolve</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card rv">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2 class="t-2">What goes wrong when it's made badly</h2>
          <p class="sm" style="margin-top:16px">Let moisture in during granulation, compression or packing and the reaction starts early. The tablet swells, the strip bloats, and the customer opens a tube of powder. It usually happens weeks later, in a warehouse, long after anyone could catch it.</p>
          <p class="sm" style="margin-top:14px">So the facility is built around controlling one variable: dehumidified production rooms held under 25% RH from granulation through to pack, moisture-barrier packaging, and a release test no batch skips.</p>
          <p class="sm" style="margin-top:14px">It is also why effervescent is the format most contract manufacturers quietly avoid &mdash; and why it became our speciality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="card sunk stat"><b>&lt;25<u>%</u></b><span>RH, throughout</span></div>
          <div class="card sunk stat"><b>21<u>&deg;C</u></b><span>Room temperature</span></div>
          <div class="card sunk stat"><b data-count="36" data-suffix="k/hr">0</b><span>Tablet output</span></div>
          <div class="card sunk stat"><b data-count="500">0</b><span>Units minimum</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="narrow center rv">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our facility</p>
      <h2 class="t-1" style="margin-top:14px">State-of-the-art<br>manufacturing</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;margin-inline:auto">Every Ascovita product is made in our own GMP-certified facility, giving us total control over quality from raw material to finished product.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4vw,48px)">
      <div class="card rv" data-tilt><h3 class="t-3">FSSAI-licensed plant</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Fully licensed food-grade manufacturing with regular government audits and full regulatory compliance.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv s1" data-tilt><h3 class="t-3">All formats in-house</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Effervescent tablets, capsules, softgels, strips and powder &mdash; all manufactured under one roof, with no outsourced steps.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv s2" data-tilt><h3 class="t-3">3rd party lab tested</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Every batch independently tested for purity, potency and safety, with results on file for every SKU.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv" data-tilt><h3 class="t-3">Certified nutritionists</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Every formulation developed and validated by qualified nutritionists and food scientists.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv s1" data-tilt><h3 class="t-3">Traceable ingredients</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Full farm-to-capsule traceability &mdash; we know the source of every ingredient in every product.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv s2" data-tilt><h3 class="t-3">ISO packaging</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Alu-Alu, blister, strip and effervescent tube formats &mdash; packaging that protects and preserves.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="narrow center rv">
      <p class="eyebrow">Dosage formats</p>
      <h2 class="t-1" style="margin-top:14px">Six formats,<br>full custom artwork</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;margin-inline:auto">FSSAI-compliant labels, manufactured and delivered under your brand. MOQ from 500 units per SKU.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4vw,48px)">
      <div class="card rv" data-tilt><span class="chip">TAB</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">Tablets</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Compressed or film-coated, in standard or custom shapes. Ideal for vitamins, minerals and herbal supplements needing precise dosing.</p><div class="pills" style="margin-top:16px"><span>Strip pack</span><span>Blister</span><span>Bottle</span></div></div>
      <div class="card rv s1" data-tilt><span class="chip">CAP</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">Capsules</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Hard gelatin or vegetarian HPMC for herbal extracts, powders and nutraceutical blends. Fast-dissolve options available.</p><div class="pills" style="margin-top:16px"><span>Hard gelatin</span><span>Veg HPMC</span><span>Softgel</span></div></div>
      <div class="card rv s2" data-tilt><span class="chip">EFF</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">Effervescent</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Our speciality. Fizzy tablets with superior bioavailability &mdash; Vitamin C, Glutathione, Biotin, B-complex and custom blends.</p><div class="pills" style="margin-top:16px"><span>Tube 10s/20s</span><span>Strip</span><span>Custom flavour</span></div></div>
