      <div class="card rv s1" data-tilt><span class="chip">SAC</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">Sachet</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Single-serve or multi-serve &mdash; suited to on-the-go nutrition, hospital samples, travel packs and gifting sets.</p><div class="pills" style="margin-top:16px"><span>Single-serve</span><span>Trial pack</span><span>Custom print</span></div></div>
      <div class="card rv s2" data-tilt><span class="chip">CHW</span><h3 class="t-3" style="margin-top:16px">Chewable</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:10px">Flavoured chewables for children, elderly and taste-sensitive consumers. Multivitamins, functional gummies and mineral chews.</p><div class="pills" style="margin-top:16px"><span>Fruit flavours</span><span>Sugar-free</span><span>Bottle / strip</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card rv">
      <p class="eyebrow">Quality</p>
      <h2 class="t-1" style="margin-top:14px;max-width:18ch">If it isn't written down, it didn't happen.</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px">Every batch we release carries a paper trail: which raw material lot went in, who compressed it, what the release tests said, and a retained sample on a shelf in case anyone ever needs to check. That record is what a distributor, a private-label client and an export buyer are all actually buying.</p>
      <div class="grid-4" style="margin-top:36px">
        <div class="card sunk"><h3 class="t-3">WHO-GMP</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:9px">Compliant facility and process controls.</p></div>
        <div class="card sunk"><h3 class="t-3">FSSAI licensed</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:9px">Approved for food supplement manufacture, regularly audited.</p></div>
        <div class="card sunk"><h3 class="t-3">Certificate of analysis</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:9px">Issued against specification, every batch, with retained samples.</p></div>
        <div class="card sunk"><h3 class="t-3">Traceability</h3><p class="sm" style="margin-top:9px">Raw material lot through to finished pack.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

