      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;max-width:64ch">The franchise programme is open pan-India. You get an appointed territory, a brand customers already recognise, and a supply chain that already works &mdash; so you are selling from week one instead of building a brand from zero.</p>

      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,3.5vw,44px)">
