<div class="page" id="pg-faq" data-route="/faq" data-title="Frequently asked questions — MOQ, lead time, certifications | Ascovita Healthcare" data-desc="MOQ, lead times, certifications, artwork, export documentation and the franchise model — answers for distributors, private-label clients and export buyers." hidden>

<section class="phero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow rv">Frequently asked questions</p>
    <h1 class="t-hero rv s1" style="margin-top:18px">Answers,<br><span class="grad">before you ask</span>.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv s2">The questions distributors, private-label clients and export buyers ask us most. Anything else, message us and a founder will reply.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rows">
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">What is your minimum order quantity?</h3></summary><p class="sm">MOQ starts at 500 units per SKU for private label and third-party manufacturing. Volume tiers step up from there, with better pricing at 2,000, 10,000 and 50,000 units.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">How long does a B2B order take?</h3></summary><p class="sm">First enquiry to first delivery is typically 3&ndash;4 weeks. You get a formulation proposal and pricing sheet within 48 hours, then lab samples for approval before production starts.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">Do you manufacture to my own formulation?</h3></summary><p class="sm">Yes. Third-party manufacturing means we produce to your exact specification in our GMP-certified facility, across effervescent, capsule, tablet, softgel, powder, sachet and chewable formats.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">What certifications do you hold?</h3></summary><p class="sm">The plant is FSSAI licensed and WHO-GMP compliant, with regular government audits. Every batch is independently third-party lab tested for purity, potency and safety, with results on file for every SKU.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">Can you handle label design and artwork?</h3></summary><p class="sm">Yes. We provide FSSAI-compliant label printing, full custom artwork support, QR code and barcode integration, and dispatch-ready carton packing.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">Which packaging formats do you offer?</h3></summary><p class="sm">Alu-Alu, blister packs, strip packaging, effervescent tubes in 10s and 20s, bottles, jars, standup pouches and single-serve sachets.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">Do you export?</h3></summary><p class="sm">Yes, through Jayraf Export, our dedicated export-import division led by our Export Director. We have served 30+ countries and handle Certificate of Analysis, MSDS, FSSAI, phytosanitary and customs documentation end to end, plus sea and air freight, FCL and LCL.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">How does the franchise programme work?</h3></summary><p class="sm">You are appointed to a territory, carry the full Ascovita range at franchise pricing, and receive marketing collateral, POS material and priority stock allocation. It suits pharma distributors, chemist chains and health store owners. Territory availability and terms are confirmed on enquiry.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">Why are Ascovita and Ascofizz priced differently?</h3></summary><p class="sm">They are separate brands for separate channels. Ascovita is made for the retail trade and priced to protect distributor and retailer margin. Ascofizz is our online-only brand with its own SKUs and pack sizes, so e-commerce pricing never undercuts a retailer's shelf.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">Can I get a product brochure or catalogue?</h3></summary><p class="sm">Yes. Message us on WhatsApp and tell us the product or category. We send the relevant specification sheet, including COA format, shelf life, pack sizes and carton dimensions, usually within the hour during business hours.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">Who will I deal with?</h3></summary><p class="sm">Our founders directly. Every B2B enquiry reaches the leadership team &mdash; no sales reps and no intermediaries.</p></details>
      <details class="row rv"><summary><h3 class="t-3">What are your business hours?</h3></summary><p class="sm">Monday to Saturday, 9:30 AM to 6:30 PM IST. WhatsApp messages are typically answered within the hour during business hours.</p></details>
    </div>
    <div class="center" style="margin-top:36px">
      <a class="btn rv" href="https://wa.me/919898582650" data-magnetic>Ask us on WhatsApp <i>&rarr;</i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</div>
